  F(CliJobsHelp, "How many threads read the source at once. Reading files is the only part of a run spread over them; everything after it is one thread. One by default, because a threaded read leaves the passes that read what it built to find nodes in an order that costs them more than the read saves.") \
  F(CliJsonOnlyForResultVerbs, "`--json` only means anything for `build`, `compile`, and `check`") \
  F(CliLangHelp, "Language for every message this run prints. Taken from this flag alone: the locale the shell exports is not consulted, so the same command line reports the same text on every machine.") \
